cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use iTemplate2 in your research, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "iTemplate2"
abstract: >-
  iTemplate2 is an open-source Python toolbox with a desktop GUI that maps
  eye-tracking gaze data onto a canonical face template, frame by frame, for
  videos, static images, and screen-based or wearable eye-tracking recordings.
